GQmdWNC14VkN1U0c5SnR6dw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"Roper Technologies, Inc. 2026 年第三季 - 業績 - 收益電話會議演示（納斯達克股票代碼：ROP） 2026-10-23"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":3},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/882835/000088283526000009/rop-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Roper Technologies, Inc. (\"Roper,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\") is a diversified technology company. Roper has a proven, long-term, successful track record of compounding cash flow and increasing shareholder value. We operate market leading businesses that design and develop vertical software and technology enabled products for a variety of defensible niche markets.","zh":"Roper Technologies, Inc.（「羅珀」、「本公司」、「我們」、「我們的」）是一家多元化科技公司。羅珀在複合現金流和增加股東價值方面擁有經過驗證的長期成功記錄。我們經營市場領先的業務，為各種可防禦的利基市場設計和開發垂直軟體和技術支援的產品。"},{"en":"We pursue consistent and sustainable growth in revenue, earnings, and cash flow by enabling continuous improvement in the operating performance of our businesses and by acquiring businesses that offer high value-added software, services, technology-enabled products, and solutions that we believe are capable of realizing growth while maintaining high margins. We compete in many defensible niche markets and believe we are the market leader or a competitive alternative to the market leader in most of these markets.","zh":"我們透過不斷改善業務的營運績效，並收購提供高附加價值軟體、服務、技術支援的產品和解決方案的業務，我們相信這些業務能夠在保持高利潤的同時實現成長，從而追求收入、盈利和現金流的持續和可持續增長。我們在許多可防禦的利基市場中競爭，並相信我們是大多數這些市場的市場領導者或市場領導者的競爭替代品。"},{"en":"In the last three years, we have deployed approximately $8,960 of capital toward acquisitions. In 2025, this included approximately $1,850 for the acquisition of CentralReach, a leading provider of Software-as-a-Service (\"SaaS\") and AI-enabled solutions for applied behavior analysis (\"ABA\") therapy clinicians, and approximately $800 for the acquisition of Subsplash, a leading provider of AI-enabled SaaS, and integrated giving solutions, for faith-based organizations. In 2024, this included approximately $1,860 for the acquisition of Procare, a leading provider of SaaS solutions and integrated payment processing for early childhood education centers, and approximately $1,600 for the acquisition of Transact Campus, a leading provider of integrated campus technology and payment solutions serving higher education, healthcare, and business campuses, which was combined with our CBORD business.","zh":"在過去三年中，我們已投入約 8,960 美元的資金用於收購。到 2025 年，這包括收購 CentralReach（為應用行為分析（「ABA」）治療臨床醫生提供軟體即服務（「SaaS」）和人工智慧解決方案的領先提供者 CentralReach），以及收購 Subsplash（為信仰組織提供人工智慧 SaaS 和整合捐贈解決方案的領先提供者）約 800 美元。 2024 年，這包括約 1,860 美元收購 Procare（一家為幼兒教育中心提供 SaaS 解決方案和整合支付處理的領先提供者），以及約 1,600 美元收購 Transact Campus（服務於高等教育、醫療保健和商業園區的整合校園技術和支付解決方案的領先提供者），並與我們的 CBORD 業務合併。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Application Software","val":4483000000,"zh":"應用軟體部門"},{"name":"Technology Enabled Products","val":1818700000,"zh":"技術支援產品部門"},{"name":"Network Software & Systems","val":1600800000,"zh":"網路軟體和系統部門"}],"total":7902500000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Software Related","val":6129900000,"zh":"軟體相關"},{"name":"Software Related Recurring","val":4482900000,"zh":"軟體相關循環"},{"name":"Product Revenue","val":1772600000,"zh":"產品收入"},{"name":"Software Related Reoccurring","val":833100000,"zh":"軟體相關重複發生"},{"name":"Software Related Non Recurring","val":813900000,"zh":"軟體相關非經常性"}],"total":7902500000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":6872800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":541400000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"CA","val":291700000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"Rest Of World","val":125500000,"zh":"Rest Of World"},{"name":"Asia","val":71100000,"zh":"Asia"}],"total":7902500000}},"peers":["PNR","AOS","GWW","CTAS","DOV"]}}